# Cases & Pronouns Content Map

Foundation of Greek grammar: cases show word roles, pronouns demonstrate them.

## Route

```
/reference/cases-pronouns
```

## Data Source

Static content from constants:
- `@/constants/recognition` - CASE_RECOGNITION (quick rules, spot-check patterns, vocative)
- `@/constants/pronouns` - All pronoun paradigms and examples

